Abstract = {One new species of springtail, Oudemansia chenorum sp. nov., is
   described and illustrated. Pseudanurida sawayai Schuster, 1965 is
   reported from Hainan Island for the first time. An identification key
   for the species of Oudemansia Schott, 1893 is provided and remarks are
   made on its peculiar morphology as well as that of close related genera.
   The presence of pseudocelli is further confirmed on members of the genus
