   associated with South American Bats, we found two new species associated
   with Phyllostomid, Emballonurid, and Noctiniolid bats: Parichoronyssus
   alexanderfaini n. sp. associated with Rhinophylla pumilio Peters;
   Parichoronyssus gettingeri n. sp. associated with Rhynchonycteris naso
   Wied-Newied, and Noctilio leporinus Linneo. Herein we give the
   description of those new species, and additionally is included several
   new records for Parichoronyssus from the region, as well as providing a
   key to the 11 species of Parichoronyssus.},
